File-type icons from Material Icon Theme
https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme
Taken from commit 13025adc5ad10a5cc649528a2c1edec93069f1b9 (icons/), unmodified, except folder.svg,
which is folder-base.svg without its motive in the theme's default folder colour (#90a4ae) — the
icon the theme itself generates for a folder.

